            "panel_title": "Leadership",
            "panel_text": "<p>We look for strong leaders who have deep expertise in their market and believe in the core tenets of innovation.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "Values",
            "panel_text": "<p>We partner with those who align with our own values and are also seeking a mutually beneficial partnership.</p>\n"
          },
          {
            "panel_title": "Expertise",
            "panel_text": "<p>We lean on our partners&#8217; depth of experience and knowledge in their respective markets to put a plan into action on where to best drive product development.</p>\n"
